OL,3,GNEWSACouncil calls for new festival
OL,4,Aideas for patch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is calling for ideas for a
OL,7,Fnew festival to be held on its patch.
OL,9,FDurham County Council is on the lookout
OL,10,Ffor someone who can organise an event
OL,11,Fthat will become "a new centre piece in
OL,12,Fthe culture and events calendar" of the
OL,13,Farea.
OL,15,FKaren Allison, cabinet member for
OL,16,Fleisure at the Reform-led council, said
OL,17,Fthe authority wanted the event to be
OL,18,F"bold" and "ambitious".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
