OL,3,GNEWSACouncil calls for new festival
OL,4,Aideas for patch
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "We are particularly
OL,7,Finterested in ideas that bring together
OL,8,Fculture, creativity, technology,
OL,9,Finnovation, and community participation
OL,10,Fin ways that are distinctive to County
OL,11,FDurham and cannot be replicated
OL,12,Felsewhere."
